   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 497.6972,
   "end": 501.86803333333336,
   "transcript": "Any artist who has signed to a record label is technically owned by that label.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 503.08591666666666,
   "end": 503.73656666666665,
   "transcript": "OWNED!",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 504.1870166666667,
   "end": 505.28811666666667,
   "transcript": "Her word, not mine.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 507.45695,
   "end": 508.6081,
   "transcript": "When you sign,",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 508.75825,
   "end": 510.79361666666665,
   "transcript": "the company pays for your recordings.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 513.6131,
   "end": 515.5984166666667,
   "transcript": "So that the company keeps your recordings.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 517.2333833333333,
   "end": 520.0028166666667,
   "transcript": "Your voice, your tape belongs to them.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 525.5083166666667,
   "end": 527.8273,
   "transcript": "And if somebody else wants to put your voice",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 529.0451833333333,
   "end": 529.9627666666667,
   "transcript": "on their record,",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 531.28075,
   "end": 532.3151166666667,
   "transcript": "they have to go and ask",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 532.9490833333333,
   "end": 533.6164166666666,
   "transcript": "the big boss.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 534.8176166666667,
   "end": 536.58605,
   "transcript": "Which in Travis's case is epic.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 543.2593833333333,
   "end": 547.2467,
   "transcript": "That permission, gentlemen, has a name. It's called a clearance.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 549.3488,
   "end": 551.2507,
   "transcript": "It's a piece of paper. Without it,",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 552.5853666666667,
   "end": 554.3871666666666,
   "transcript": "the song cannot legally come out.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 556.7895666666667,
   "end": 559.0585,
   "transcript": "Doesn't matter if it's finished. Doesn't matter if it's brilliant.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 560.4265333333333,
   "end": 562.3284333333334,
   "transcript": "doesn't matter if anyone wants it",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 586.4525333333333,
   "end": 588.1876,
   "transcript": "and the company doesn't hand it over for free",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 591.8078833333333,
   "end": 592.94235,
   "transcript": "They take their own cut",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 595.0277666666667,
   "end": 597.1632333333333,
   "transcript": "on top of whatever the artist gets.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 599.7825166666667,
   "end": 602.9356666666666,
   "transcript": "So before Travis raps even one word,",
