   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 610.4932166666666,
   "end": 611.9947166666667,
   "transcript": "Travis, his manager,",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 614.6807333333334,
   "end": 617.46685,
   "transcript": "and the company that owns his voice and wants paying for it.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 623.9399833333333,
   "end": 627.2933333333333,
   "transcript": "And here's the mad part. You've seen this proof a thousand times.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 627.9106166666667,
   "end": 629.1952333333334,
   "transcript": "It's on every big song.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 631.3640666666666,
   "end": 632.98235,
   "transcript": "You just never knew what you were looking at.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 638.8048333333334,
   "end": 640.8568833333334,
   "transcript": "Go and look at any song",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 645.5282166666667,
   "end": 648.19755,
   "transcript": "a big artist gets on someone else's track.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 650.6166333333333,
   "end": 651.6343166666667,
   "transcript": "Look at the credits.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 654.2536,
   "end": 658.6246333333333,
   "transcript": "a line that says appears courtesy of and then a record company's",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 660.3597,
   "end": 664.9643,
   "transcript": "That's not a thank you, not an appreciation or anything like that. That's a receipt.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 667.71705,
   "end": 668.5011666666667,
   "transcript": "the receipt.",
   "no_refine": true,
   "from": "creator hand cut 2026-09-19"
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-travis-scott-synced.mov",
   "start": 670.7534166666667,
   "end": 671.5041666666667,
